Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第21集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.21,0:00:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴就要来了 而你们两个 你们就摇逸在风暴的中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm's coming. And you boys, you are smack in the middle of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的孩子 你的萨姆 还有其他的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the truth about Sammy and the other children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.89,0:00:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安迪·格立科特 - 艾娃·威尔森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andrew Gallagher. - Ava Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我谁也没有伤害 - 还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't hurt anybody. - Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.89,0:00:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯 你的能力从 7个月前开始的 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max, your abilities started seven months ago, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道 - 我们的母亲死于同一场事故{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you know that? - The same thing killed our mothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我都是被选中的 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I were chosen.For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在事情发生前 我看到这个家伙死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw this guy die, days before it happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以控制人们做事 不是吗？你可以控制他们去想些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make people do things. You can tell them what to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.45,0:00:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很棒的车 我能开下吗 - 当然 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cherry ride. Can I have it? - Sure, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定是我们中的一份子 什么？ 超能力者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be one of us. The psychics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚吧 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you, buddy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是从帕奥利亚来的秘书 我不属于任何东西的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'm a secretary from Peoria and I'm not part of anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔告诉我 他们有他们的战士 会在即将到来的战争中战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This demon tells me they have soldiers to fight in this coming war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:00:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,超能力者为恶魔战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychics fighting on hell's side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那黄眼的男人让我去做 一些事 恶心的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The yellow-eyed man tells me to do things, awful things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他告诉我他 有一个大计划 - 也许这就是他的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He told me he's got big plans. - Maybe this is his plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许我们都该是… - 什么 杀手 得了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe we're all supposed to be… - What? Killers? Give me a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人有艾娃的任何消息 她消失了 知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's heard anything about Ava. She just into thin air, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 硫磺 - 艾娃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's sulfur. - Ava.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼来过这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon's been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果坏事将要发生 它会来的很快 他们那边拥有所有的底牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something big and bad coming. Their side holds all the cards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.95,0:01:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法躲避 你也不可能保护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run from this. And you can't protect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 萨姆 整件事正逐渐失去控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Sam, this whole thing is spinning out of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 这次别忘了多加点洋葱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget the extra onions this time, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该是那个 吃着双份洋葱… 开车的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who's gonna have to ride in the car with your extra onions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 看看他们有没有馅饼卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, see if they got any pie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.53,0:02:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我带点馅饼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me some pie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我带点馅饼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love me some pie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.73,0:03:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,硫磺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulfur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.46,0:03:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.59,0:03:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.15,0:05:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:05:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这儿干嘛？- 我不知道那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 我们在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - Just…Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安迪 听着 冷静下来 - 我冷静不下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andy, look, calm down. - I can't calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚从个怪异的梦中醒来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have just woke up in frigging Frontierland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得的最后一件事是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the last thing you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.78,0:06:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽我第四根大麻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fourth bong-load.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然之间 有一种非常剧烈的味道 就像是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden, there was this really intense smell, like, uh-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像硫磺？- 你怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like sulfur? - How did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 你兄弟他… 他在这儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Your brother, is he here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他是否…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if he's-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.31,0:06:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我 我被锁在这了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, please. I'm locked in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help. Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 我在这儿 我们救你出去 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay. I'm here. We're gonna get you out, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just hold on a second. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 马上 - 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, one second. - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾娃 - 我的上帝 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ava? - Oh, my God. Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.34,0:07:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猜你俩互相认识 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I guess you know each other. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么… 我怎么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you…? I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾娃 你一直都在那里面吗？- 什么一直？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ava, have you been here this whole time? - What whole time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我半小时前在里面刚醒 - 你已经消失5个月了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just woke up in there a half an hour ago. - Well, you've been gone for five months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我兄弟到处找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother and I have been looking for you everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能 因为我在2天前刚见过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's impossible, because I saw you two days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.69,0:07:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这没有道理 这… 不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that makes no sense. It's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.57,0:07:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的未婚夫 布洛迪 如果我失踪那么久 他肯定会抓狂的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fiancé, Brady, if I've been missing for that long, he must be freaking out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.58,0:07:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 也同样抓狂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy. Also freaking out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 发生了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我真的不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't really know yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道一件事 我知道我们三个人的共通点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know one thing. I know what the three of us have in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Is anybody there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许不只3个 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe more than three. - Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 你们没事吧？- 我想是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, are you guys all right? - I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是扎克 - 莉莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Jake. - Lily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有没有其他人 - 没有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are there any more of you? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么会到这里来的？一分钟前我还在圣地亚哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did we even get here? A minute ago I was in San Diego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能让你感觉好一点的话… 昨晚我还睡在阿富汗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it makes you feel any better, I went to sleep last night in Afghanistan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我大胆的猜下 你们俩都是23岁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take a wild guess. You two are both 23?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是23岁 我们都有「能力」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all are. And we all have abilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 始于1年多前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It started a little over a year ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现你可以做那些 你从前认为不可能的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you found you could do things. Things you didn't think were possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有幻觉 我可以看到还没发生的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have visions. I see things before they happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把意志灌输到人们的脑中 像让他们做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can put thoughts into people's heads, like, make them do stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过别担心 我认为不会对你们起作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry, I don't think it works on you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.19,0:08:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是听听这个 我一直在练习…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but get this, um, I've been practicing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.53,0:08:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练我的大脑 像冥想一样 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Training my brain, like meditation, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:09:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在 我不只可以传输意志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now, it's not just thoughts I can beam out but images too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样还有图像 像… 我想到的任何东西 就像… 哗 人们就看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, anything I want. It's like, bam! People, they see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识一个家伙 绝对的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one guy I know, total dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在他身上使用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used it on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,和同性恋做爱了一整天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gay porn, all hours of the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是… 你们应该看看他的表情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just like-You should have seen the look on his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么如果你说「西蒙说把你 的钱包给我」 他们就会做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you go, "Simon says give me your wallet, " and they do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有幻觉？ 那很棒 我非常想要那样的能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have visions? That's great. I'd kill for something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉莉 听着 没事的 - 不 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lily, listen. It's okay. - No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.32,0:09:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我碰到人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I touch people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,人的心脏就会停止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}their hearts stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎不能离开我的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can barely leave my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活也根本没有好转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life's not exactly improved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以滚你的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So screw you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只想回家 - 我们不想吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just wanna go home. - And what, we don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别那样和我说话 - 嗨 伙计们 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't talk to me like that. - Hey gus please come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 无论我们喜不喜欢 我们都在这里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, whether we like it or not, we're all here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们都要面对这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so we all have to deal with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把我们带到这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who brought us here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:10:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不该是「谁」 更应该是「什么」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's less of a who. It's more of a what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个月所有 出现恶魔征兆和预示的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All demonic signs and omens over the past month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开玩笑吗 这什么都没有 - 完全正确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're joking, there's nothing here. - Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 一定会有什么的 那正常的呢 低等级的那些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. There's gotta be something. What about the normal, low-level stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道的 驱魔招魂那种 - 我告诉你了 什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exorcisms, that kind of thing. - That's what I'm telling you. Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,完完全全的安静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's completely quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们怎么找萨姆 闭上眼睛点地图吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we supposed to look for Sam? Close our eyes and point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿什 有什么线索吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ash, what do you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听着 没有什么关于萨姆的线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen, it's a big negatory on Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 伙计 你得给我们些线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you gotta give us something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.65,0:10:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在这儿对着 3000多英里长的干草堆发呆呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking at a 3000-mile haystack here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Dean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确找到了一些线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did find something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能在电话里说 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't talk over this line, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行了 我没有时间 - 找时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, I don't have time for this. - Make time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？ 因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, because this-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.19,0:11:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好？ 有什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up? What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是这事 基本一定会帮助你找到你弟弟的 这只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only does this almost definitely help you find your brother, this is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太惊人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以到这儿来 马上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So get here. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们要去路边旅馆了 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're going to the Roadhouse. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.01,0:11:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说我们是启示录中提到的 恶魔战争中的士兵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're soldiers in a demon war to bring on the Apocalypse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要那样想的话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you put it like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是被挑选出来的 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And we've been picked? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么是我们- 我不确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why us? - I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 但是你瞧 我知道… - 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, but look, I just know…Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 通灵和特异功能是一回事 但是恶魔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, psychics and spoon bending is one thing. But demons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道这听起来很疯狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}look I know it sounds crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.98,0:11:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 并不仅仅是听起来疯狂 - 我不关心你怎么想的 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't just sound it. - I really don't care what you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果我们被聚在一起了 就意味着开始了 那么我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're all gathered here that means it's starting. We gotta-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一要做的就是 远离白痴 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I gotta do is stay away from wack jobs, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听够了 我要自己走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard enough. I'm better off on my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你们来说 最好也一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}FYI, so are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.33,0:11:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎克 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake. Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 别害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. Don't be scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迷路了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you lost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你们知道了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是个魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个东西？我不确定 但是我想是只阿奇雷鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing, I'm not sure, but I think it was an Acheri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.85,0:13:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种把自己伪装成小女孩的魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon that disguises itself as a little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没表明我们在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still doesn't tell us where we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安迪 你要不要和我一起 - 给我一分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andy, are you with me or what? - Give me a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在考虑「魔鬼是真实的」 这个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still working through "demons are real."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从前见过那座钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen that bell before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道我们现在在哪里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know where we are now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.41,0:13:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷橡木 南达科他州{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold Oak, South Dakota.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个镇子太闹鬼 以至于所有居民都逃离了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A town so haunted, every single resident fled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 很高兴知道我们在 一个如此著名的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swell. Good to know we're somewhere so historical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么那个魔鬼 无论是什么把我们带到这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why in the world would that demon or whatever put us here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在疑惑这个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wondering the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.59,0:14:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？ 这无所谓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? It doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一该做的理智的事情 就是离开这该死的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, the only sane thing to do here is get the hell out of Dodge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等一下 莉莉 唯一离开这里的路 是穿过厚厚的丛林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, hold on. Lily, the only way out's through miles of woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比跟魔鬼在一起好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats hanging out with demons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉 听着 我们还不知道到底发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily, look, we don't know what's going on yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.20,0:14:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们甚至都不知道 这里有多少魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know how many of them are out there right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 他是对的 我们应该… - 不要说「我们」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, he's right. We should just…Don't say we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是「我们」中的一部分 我和你们中任何一个 都没有共通点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not part of we. I have nothing in common with any of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 听着 听着 我知道… - 你什么都不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, look, look, I know that… - You don't know anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我碰…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意外的碰到了我的女朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I accidentally touched my girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉我是在一个噩梦之中 而且噩梦变的越来越坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I'm in a nightmare and it just keeps getting worse and worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.47,0:14:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也失去了亲人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost people too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在外面 我有一个哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a brother out there right now. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 他可能已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be dead for all I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都处于不好的形势之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all in bad shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我要告诉你 最好的解决问题的办法 就是团结在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you, the best way out of this is to stick together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找铁 银和盐 任何的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for iron, silver, salt, any kind of weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 盐是种武器 - 这是个全新的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Salt is a weapon? - It's a brave new world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你的世界里面有食物 因为我他妈的饿死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hopefully there's food in your world because I'm frigging starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.95,0:16:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到艾伦了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see Ellen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没看到阿什{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Ash either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 阿什 见鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Ash. Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm just-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:17:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 有点头晕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, a little dizzy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你… 你确定不是某种… 什么 某种奇怪的幻象？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure it's not some kind of…What? Some kind of freaky vision thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 更像是会为一个三明治 被折磨死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. More like, I'd kill for a sandwich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我滴水未进已经有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't eaten since-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这… 别担心 我没事 除了接连发生的这些事以外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's-Don't worry. I'm fine, except for every thing that's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我找到了些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys? I found something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 盐 - 这太好了 安迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Salt. That's great, Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.85,0:18:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们都…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we all-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Lily?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.25,0:18:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.40,0:18:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真正的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's officially-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 她死了 她死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, she's dead, she's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.45,0:19:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过我们因为 某种原因被挑选上了 那不是被挑选{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said we were chosen for a reason. That is not chosen. That's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是被杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 知道嘛 我们得离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yup. We have to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我赞成这种心情 - 但并不确定那是种选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I second that emotion. - Not sure that's an option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么- 莉莉试图离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Lily was trying to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔不会让我们 这么容易就离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon's not gonna let us get away that easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得准备好防御 下一次袭击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta gear up for the next attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. Gear up? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.58,0:19:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我不是士兵 我做不来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I'm not a soldier. I can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.73,0:19:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你想活下来 你就得去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you wanna stay alive, you're gonna have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我把她放下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get her down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗… 我刚刚在想迪恩现在 能帮上多少忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm just thinking about how much Dean would help right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一部好用的电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd give my arm for a working phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你也许不需要电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you may not need one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.23,0:19:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 呃 我是说 我以前从来没试过远距离的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh-I mean, I've never tried it long distance before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:20:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上有迪恩的什么东西吗 比如他碰过的东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you have anything of Dean's on you? Like something he touched?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有张收据 这有用吗 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got a-I got a receipt. Will that work? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,D·哈塞尔霍夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"D·Hasselhoff?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.33,0:20:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 那是迪恩的签名 这…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's Dean's signature. It-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.71,0:20:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很难解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿什到底知道什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell did Ash know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本没法知道艾伦在哪儿 或者她是否还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got no way of knowing where Ellen is or if she's even alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不知道阿什 到底想告诉我们什么 我们怎么才能找到萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got no clue what Ash was gonna tell us. Now how the hell are we gonna find Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.98,0:20:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.16,0:20:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 头疼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Headache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常这样头疼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get headaches like that a lot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.71,0:21:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是压力造成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be the stress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定我看到什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have swore I saw something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 像… 像幻象 像萨姆那种的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, like-Like a vision? Like what Sam gets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 不 - 我只是问问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? No. - I'm just saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我不是那种通灵的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I'm not some psychic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.19,0:21:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.44,0:21:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听到我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我想是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.78,0:21:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.66,0:21:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他了 鲍比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him, Bobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是种幻象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.71,0:21:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.62,0:21:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, yeah. Hoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就和掉进天堂一样有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was about as fun as getting kicked in the jewels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还看到了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.09,0:21:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有一座钟 - 什么样的钟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There was a bell. - What kind of bell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.01,0:21:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 像一个大…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, like a big bell with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一座上面有某种雕刻的大钟 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}some kind of engraving on it, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雕刻？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Engraving? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.60,0:21:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一棵树吗 就像 一棵橡树？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it a tree? Like an oak tree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.48,0:22:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 完全正确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.11,0:22:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道萨姆在哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where Sam is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.30,0:22:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我不是什么超人 不是什么重要的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm-I'm not Superman or anything. It's no big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 之前你在阿富汗 - 我开始是头疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were in Afghanistan when this started? - Yeah, I started getting headaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.09,0:22:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了一次事故 有个伙计在一条破路上翻了车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was this accident. This guy flipped his vehicle on a bad road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,被卡在下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got pinned underneath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.14,0:22:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像抬空气一样 把车从他身上抬起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lifted it off him like it was nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.65,0:22:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都说这是 肾上腺素分泌异常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody said it was a fluke adrenaline thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.78,0:22:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是后来你又做了一次 对吗 - 800磅的台式压床{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But then you did it again, right? - Bench pressed 800 pounds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.86,0:22:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻而易举{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stone-cold calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.49,0:22:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我从来没告诉过任何人 这太疯狂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told anybody, of course. It's just too crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 疯狂是相对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but crazy's relative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:22:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始理解了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to get that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.87,0:23:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一下 我 呃… 谢谢你所做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I, uh-I appreciate what you're doing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.21,0:23:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做了什么 - 保持冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What am I doing? - Keeping calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家保持冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping them calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是当想到自己是多么的古怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially considering how freaked to hell you really are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.18,0:23:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前一度非常垂头丧气 我知道是什么样子的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been in some deep crap before myself. I know the look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道真相吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.57,0:23:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个哥哥 对吧？他一直都告诉我他会如何保护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this brother, right? He's always telling me how he's gonna watch out for me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会没事的 就像我告诉他们的那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how everything's gonna be okay, kind of like I'm telling them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.91,0:23:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.99,0:23:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我不知道我还会不会相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I believe it this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.33,0:23:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 这次所面对的东西的能力…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the size of what's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.67,0:23:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,比任何人所见过的都强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bigger than anyone's ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.00,0:23:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 这将会很糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's gonna get bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.80,0:23:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我不知道能否…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I-I don't know if-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.30,0:23:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是否能挺过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're gonna make it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.68,0:23:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是否相信不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter if we believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.14,0:23:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们相信才重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only matters that they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.54,0:24:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的占卜说我当初 不应该醒过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My horoscope said I shouldn't have gotten out of bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.38,0:24:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.97,0:24:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坚持的住吗 - 我还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holding up? - I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.14,0:24:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.31,0:24:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.98,0:24:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我们 萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why us, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.35,0:24:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做了什么遭受这个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did we do to deserve this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.57,0:24:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜只是幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just lucky I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是坏运气的话 也不应该一点运气都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't for bad luck, wouldn't have no luck at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.86,0:25:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫不及待希望这能结束 那样我就可以装作 从来都没有发生过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't wait for this all to be over so I can just pretend it never happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.87,0:25:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想蜷缩在布雷迪的怀里 看深夜节目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to curl up with Brady and watch bad TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.75,0:25:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.34,0:25:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.72,0:25:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.26,0:25:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么我不知道的事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}know something that I don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.80,0:25:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 艾娃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Ava. I-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.39,0:25:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很抱歉 我希望不必告诉你这些 - 告诉我什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, I wish I didn't have to tell you. - Tell me what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.11,0:25:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当恶魔…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the demon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.52,0:25:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯到你家带走你的时候…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}broke into your house to take you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.65,0:25:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的未婚夫没能活下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your fiancé didn't make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.53,0:25:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.82,0:26:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎克 你后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake. Behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.24,0:26:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.75,0:26:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在做梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.62,0:26:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.71,0:26:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去散个步怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and I take a little walk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.68,0:26:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很安静 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're awfully quiet, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.18,0:26:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没跟我生气 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not mad at me, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.69,0:26:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你碎尸万段的 我发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna tear you to shreds, I swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你醒过来 老虎 你再全力以赴吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you wake up, tiger, you give it your best shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.32,0:26:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我哥在哪儿 - 别再担心迪恩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's my brother? - Quit worrying about Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.03,0:27:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的话会更担心自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd worry more about yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.91,0:27:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你要杀了我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you gonna kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.70,0:27:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在帮你 这就是为什么我们在谈话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to help you. That's why we're talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.16,0:27:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那个我一直支持的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one I'm rooting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.38,0:27:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.88,0:27:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到美国小姐竞选{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Miss America Pageant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.71,0:27:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你在这儿是为了什么？这是一场竞赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think you're here? This is a competition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.22,0:27:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群疯狂的孩子里 只有一个能活着离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one of you crazy kids is gonna make it out of here alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.72,0:27:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为我们应该是 - 即将来临的战争中的战士 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought we were supposed to be…Soldiers in a coming war? That's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.10,0:27:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是 但是重点是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are. But here's the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.06,0:27:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.86,0:27:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要「战士」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.90,0:27:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need the one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.74,0:27:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 我不能就这么说出来 不是吗 萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Well, I couldn't just say that, could I Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.91,0:27:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得让每个人都认为 他们有战斗的资格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to let everyone think they had a fighting chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.58,0:27:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我需要的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I need…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.75,0:27:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个领导者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.42,0:27:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,领导谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To lead who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.84,0:27:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我已经有了我的军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've already got my army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.55,0:27:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, I will…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.59,0:28:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就会有了 不管怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}soon anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.34,0:28:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.80,0:28:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我很惊讶你居然没猜到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I'm surprised you hadn't guessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.35,0:28:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你认为那么多孩子 都死了是为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why do you think so many children flamed out already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.47,0:28:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克思·米勒还有安迪的兄弟 他的名字是什么来着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max Miller and Andy's brother, what's-his-name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.23,0:28:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不够强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't strong enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.31,0:28:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在寻找你们这一代中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for the best and brightest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.40,0:28:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好最聪明的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your generation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.66,0:28:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这一代？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My generation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.28,0:28:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他年代的 但是让我们先考虑你这一代的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.There's other generations. But let's just worry about yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.29,0:28:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是为什么我在这儿 我想让你处于一个 有利的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm here, Sam. I wanna give you the inside track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.62,0:28:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坚强 你聪明 你接受了很好的培训{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're tough, you're smart, you're well-trained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.54,0:28:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to your daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.13,0:28:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.42,0:28:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.59,0:28:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的最爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.39,0:28:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毁了我的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ruined my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.35,0:28:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了每一个我爱的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed everyone I love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.35,0:28:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕这就是做生意的成本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cost of doing business, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.73,0:28:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.23,0:28:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜美的小杰西卡…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sweet little Jessica?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.65,0:29:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是不得不死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just had to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.61,0:29:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经准备好要和她结婚了 那个金发的小东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were all set to marry that little blond thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.28,0:29:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为一个税务律师 两个孩子 啤酒肚 然后在市郊有一座宅邸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Become a tax lawyer with two kids, a beer gut and a McMansion in the suburbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.99,0:29:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你变得敏锐 在路上 磨练你的技能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed you sharp, on the road, honing your skills…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.46,0:29:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天赋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.21,0:29:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我的妈妈呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.29,0:29:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是坏运气 - 坏运气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was bad luck. - Bad luck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.59,0:29:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走进来看到我们 错的地点 错的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She walked in on us. Wrong place, wrong time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.67,0:29:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么意思 - 不是关于她 是关于你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does that mean? - It wasn't about her. It was about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.39,0:29:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是关于你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always been about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.27,0:29:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.19,0:29:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.69,0:29:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正好碰到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You caught me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.32,0:29:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仁慈的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a charitable mood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.40,0:29:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.57,0:29:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去熟悉吗 应该是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look familiar? It should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.87,0:29:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 萨姆 这只是个高真的即时回放 欣赏表演吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Sam. This is just a hi-def instant replay. Enjoy the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.54,0:30:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 - 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John. - Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.42,0:30:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他饿了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.22,0:30:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.68,0:30:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.09,0:30:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.35,0:30:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚跟你说什么了 萨姆 她听不到你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I just tell you, Sam, she can't hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.77,0:30:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.31,0:30:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见鬼的你在对我做什么 - 比母亲的乳汁更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are you doing to me? - Better than mother's milk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.86,0:30:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不是意味着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean I have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.32,0:30:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身体里流着恶魔的血？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}demon blood in me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.70,0:30:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.83,0:30:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你 - 她认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's you. - She knew you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.92,0:30:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.76,0:30:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.76,0:30:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不会想看剩下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you wanna see the rest of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.27,0:30:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.89,0:30:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ava's missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.79,0:31:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去检查畜舍和旅馆 你去检查房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the barn and the hotel, you take the houses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.50,0:31:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 10分钟后回来这儿见 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Meet back here in 10 minutes, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.79,0:31:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.99,0:31:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ava.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.49,0:31:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑哪儿去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.66,0:31:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没听到我们喊你吗 - 是的 我有听到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Didn't you hear us yelling? - Yeah, I heard you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.34,0:32:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.51,0:32:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.00,0:32:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我找到他时 他就这样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. I just found him like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.09,0:32:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事了 - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.92,0:32:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西怎么进来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd that thing get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.93,0:33:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是去井里弄点水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just went to get some water from the well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.77,0:33:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只走开了大概2分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was only gone maybe, like, two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.40,0:33:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该出去的 艾娃我们必须待在房子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have gone outside. Ava, we have to stay in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.24,0:33:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁干的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.03,0:33:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 也许是安迪… - 安迪不会这么做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know, maybe Andy…Andy wouldn't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.24,0:33:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃 我走的时候 盐线还没有断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ava, that line wasn't broken when I left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.17,0:33:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾娃 - 什么 你不会认为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ava. - Why? You don't think that I-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.96,0:33:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你我怎么想的 5个月了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what I think. Five months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.42,0:33:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是唯一一个不能说明 那段时间自己在哪儿的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one with all that time you can't account for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.55,0:33:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头疼的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that headache you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.38,0:33:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正是莉莉被劫走的时候 - 你想要说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right when the demon got Lily. - What are you trying to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.30,0:33:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到底怎么了 - 什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to you? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.28,0:33:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终还是没骗倒你 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had you going though, didn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.61,0:33:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.07,0:34:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里已经很久了 也并不孤单… 不断有人出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been here a long time. And not alone, either. People just keep showing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.75,0:34:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 像我们这样的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children, like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.08,0:34:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一批大概3或4个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batches of three or four at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.30,0:34:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他们 全部？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed them? All of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.17,0:34:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这里不可战胜的 重量级冠军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the undefeated heavyweight champ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.38,0:34:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.80,0:34:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想上帝没什么用处 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think God has much to do with this, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.97,0:34:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.64,0:34:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.98,0:34:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我死就是他们亡 过了一段时间 也挺容易的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me or them. After a while, it was easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.81,0:34:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至也很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was even kind of fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.98,0:34:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是不再斗争了 - 斗争什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just stopped fighting it. - Fighting what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.53,0:34:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是谁 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who we are, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.99,0:34:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你挣脱自己的束缚 张开双臂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you just quit your hand-wringing and open yourself up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.99,0:34:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道自己的能耐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have no idea what you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.95,0:34:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,学习过程非常快 近乎颠狂 那开关 就像在你脑子里一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The learning curve is so fast, it's crazy. The switches that just flip in your brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.33,0:34:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我是从 做梦开始的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I started out just having dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.42,0:34:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我现在能做什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I can do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.55,0:35:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control demons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.51,0:35:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are quick on the draw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.85,0:35:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Sam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.61,0:35:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 都结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.05,0:35:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来剩下的路要步行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like the rest of the way's on foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.64,0:35:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.23,0:36:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我- 想现在我们能离开这里了 - 但那个阿奇雷魔鬼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think we can make it out of here now. - But the Acheri demon-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.20,0:36:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 是艾娃召唤控制的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Ava was summoning it, controlling it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.07,0:36:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了那东西就不会出来了 我们得离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shouldn't come back now that she's dead. We gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.58,0:36:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是「我们」 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not we, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.12,0:36:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之中只有一个能离开这里 我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one of us is getting out of here. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.58,0:36:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我… 我有过幻象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I…I had a vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.37,0:36:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个黄眼魔鬼 不管他是什么… 他和我说过话 他告诉我怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Yellow-Eyed demon or whatever. He talked to me. He told me how it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.75,0:36:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 扎克 听着 你不能相信他的话 - 萨姆 他不会让我们走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no Jake, you can't listen to him…Sam, he's not letting us go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.42,0:36:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.67,0:36:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不单飞的话 他会把我们两个都杀死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we don't play along, he'll kill us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.34,0:36:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你 老兄 真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I like you, man, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.26,0:36:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你仔细想想 我们两个都死了有什么好处？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do the math here. What good's it do for both of us to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.26,0:36:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能离开这里 我接近那魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I can get out of here. I get close to the demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.77,0:36:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能杀了那杂种 - 和我一起 我们可以一起杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can kill the bastard. - You come with me, we kill him together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.94,0:36:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么知道你不会出卖我 - 我不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do I know you won't turn on me? - I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.69,0:36:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.65,0:36:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.17,0:36:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一起去吧 扎克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come with me, Jake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.63,0:36:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.30,0:37:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他得到他想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't play into what it wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.65,0:37:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.78,0:38:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.62,0:38:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.79,0:39:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Look out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.34,0:39:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.43,0:39:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.60,0:39:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.85,0:39:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.52,0:39:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边 让我看看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come here. You're okay, champ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.28,0:39:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧 看着我 没那么糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Look. Look at me. It's not even that bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.86,0:39:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么糟 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even that bad, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.57,0:39:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆？萨姆 嘿 听我说 我们会把你治好的 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy? Sam. Hey, listen to me. We're gonna patch you up, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.62,0:39:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会完好痊愈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be good as new. Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.67,0:39:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会照顾你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take care of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.46,0:39:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我照顾你 这是我的责任 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. It's my job, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.50,0:39:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我那没出息的弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out for my pain-in-the-ass little brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.51,0:39:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.05,0:39:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.34,0:39:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.22,0:40:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.98,0:40:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.06,0:40:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.05,0:40:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!{\r}
